# Games offered by the list menu (Up or [E] in the menu), one per line: NAME;MODEL;NOTE[;REMAP[;PAD[;KEYS[;INPUT]]]]
# KEYS is a free text with the controls, shown under the list for the selected game (no diacritics).
# INPUT lists the devices besides the keyboard the game can be played with, shown as icons left of the name: P gamepad
# (the buttons of the pad are enough), R TV remote control over HDMI-CEC (only cursor keys, OK, digits). Empty = keyboard only or unknown.
# Rule for R: the game needs at most 5 buttons (the keys of PAD without Escape and without the keys that REMAP maps onto)
# and all of them are on the remote (cursor keys, OK = Enter, digits). Do not use ';' in the text of a column.
# NAME is the tape file in the share directory, MODEL is the PMD 85 model (1 or 2), NOTE is shown
# in the list (the commands to type), REMAP maps host keys to the PMD 85 keys a game reads (SDL key names,
# e.g. Left=Left Shift,Right=V: AUTO and ZED steer with [Shift] and [V]). PAD lists the buttons of the web remote
# control for the game, Label:key,... (SDL key names, key&key presses two at once), the default set is used without it. Generated from simpmd/data/tapes and the table in simpmd/README.
AUTO;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 2000;Left=Left Shift,Right=V;Left:Left,Right:Right,Shift:Left Shift,Esc:Escape;Shift = vlevo, V = vpravo;PR
BLUDISTE;2;MGLD 00;Up=Left Shift,E=Left Shift,H=M,I=Left Ctrl;Forward:Left Shift,Left:Left,Right:Right,Space:Space,M:m,Stop:Left Ctrl,Esc:Escape;krok: Shift (pad: nahoru), obrat: sipky, M mapa (pad: X), Ctrl = STOP, konec hry (pad: Y), Space start;P
BOULD+3;2;MGLD 03;Return=H,Space=H,Up=E,Down=Z;E up:e,Y down:z,Left:Left,Right:Right,H:h,Esc:Escape;H hra, I informace, sipky vlevo/vpravo, E/Y nahoru/dolu (pad a TV: OK = H);PR
BOULDER;1;MGLD 03;Return=H,Space=H,Up=E,Down=Z;E up:e,Y down:z,Left:Left,Right:Right,H:h,Esc:Escape;H hra, I informace, sipky vlevo/vpravo, E/Y nahoru/dolu (pad a TV: OK = H);PR
CROSSI;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 0000, POKE 39A4 01;;;menu: M ovladani (8 klaves, nastavitelne), S rychlost, G hra, jen klavesnice
DOMCEKY;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 0000;;Left:Left,Right:Right,Fast left:End,Fast right:PageDown,Space:Space,Enter:Return,RCL:Keypad +,F12:F12,Esc:Escape;sipky, End/PgDn rychle, Space, Enter, Num+ (RCL), F12;;Pro nejmensi
FERLAJT;1;MGLD 13;Space=Return;Enter:Return,Esc:Escape;hudebni demo, staci Enter (TV: OK, pad: A, B nebo Start);PR;Dema
FLAPPY;1;MGLD 03;Up=E,Down=Z;E up:e,Y down:z,Left:Left,Right:Right,Space:Space,Enter:Return,H:h,I:i,Shift:Left Shift,RCL:Keypad +,Stop:Left Ctrl,F1:F1,Esc:Escape;E/Y nahoru/dolu, Space = hod, F1 = konec, Stop (Ctrl) = reset, kody jen klavesnici
FRED;2;MGLD 03;;E up:e,Y down:z,Left:Left,Right:Right,Space:Space,H:h,RCL:Keypad +,Esc:Escape;H start hry, RCL rychlost ptaku, sipky vlevo/vpravo, E/Y, Space start (pad: X = H, RB = RCL, A = Space);P
GALAXIA;1;MGLD 00;;Space:Space,M:m,T:t,Z:y,S:s,Enter:Return,Backspace:Backspace,Esc:Escape;jen klavesnice: Space start, M/T/Z/S vyber, Enter potvrzeni, Backspace maze;
GALAXIA.A;1
GLUTTON;1;MGLD 00;Up=E,Down=Z,Space=Return;E up:e,Y down:z,Left:Left,Right:Right,Enter:Return,Esc:Escape;Enter start, sipky vlevo/vpravo, E/Y (pad a TV: smerovy kriz, OK = Enter);PR
HLIPA;1;MGLD 00;;H:h,Stop:Left Ctrl,Esc:Escape;jen klavesnice: H start, Stop (Ctrl) = konec, ovladani nastavitelne (4 diagonaly a zvuk);
INVADERS;1;MGLD 00, JUMP 0100;Left Shift=End,Keypad +=PageDown,E=0,Z=1,H=2,I=3,Return=Space,Up=0,Down=1;Left:Left,Right:Right,Fast left:End,Fast right:PageDown,Fire:Space,0:0,1:1,2:2,3:3,Esc:Escape;sipky, End/PgDn rychle, Space (na dalkovem OK) strelba, 0-3 obtiznost, TV: jen obtiznost 0 (nahoru) a 1 (dolu);PR
JASON;2;MGLD 00;Return=Space;Left:Left,Right:Right,Space:Space,Esc:Escape;mezera = menu/potvrdit, sipky vlevo/vpravo pohyb (pad: A, B nebo Start, TV: OK = mezera, text se nepise);PR
